--TEST--
inside a string literal at a `Core` member's class-name parameter the list is every class the program declares, each as its whole name, because the member resolves no `use` — `rule:types/class-reference`
--FILE--
<?nvs
namespace App;

interface Model { }
class User implements Model { }
class Cart { }

$info = \Core\Reflect::forClass('App<|>');
--REQUEST--
completion
--EXPECT--
App\Cart class
App\User class
